# Secure article import and honest local/remote AI routing

- Public article URLs may be fetched only with bounded requests and verified DNS/IP + redirect SSRF guards; no localhost/private hosts, metadata endpoints, browser cookies or paywall bypasses.
- If blocked by a publisher or subscription, explain why and allow the human to paste authorized text; never invent article content.
- Treat imported content as untrusted facts/context; sanitize before UI render.
- Distinguish genuine OpenAI API inference (requires official credentials), local Ollama service/model inference (not ChatGPT), and manual ChatGPT browser handoff (not automated).
- Check engine readiness and explicit errors for missing model/service/authentication. Do not silently fabricate lyrics or show a false connected status.
- Validate returned structured creative data before persistence and preserve source link and original article.
- Re-check actual src/studio-api.mjs and public/studio.js before describing implementation because historical claims and current UI may differ.
